B.baK=s(["Y\u0131lda 2 kez rutin t\u0131rnak kesimi; topal inek 48 saat i\xe7inde bak\u0131ls\u0131n.","Ayak banyosu (formalin/bak\u0131r s\xfclfat) haftada 2\u20133 kez, \xe7\xf6zelti 150\u2013200 ge\xe7i\u015fte yenilensin.","Zeminde kayma, \xe7ukur ve g\xfcbre birikimi giderilsin; bekleme alan\u0131nda s\xfcre k\u0131salt\u0131ls\u0131n.","Asidozu \xf6nleyen rasyon (yeterli kaba yem/efektif lif), biotin-\xe7inko takviyesi.","Ayl\u0131k topall\u0131k skorlamas\u0131 yap\u0131l\u0131p kayda ge\xe7sin."],t.s)
B.byG=new A.dd("Digital dermatit (Treponema), t\u0131rnak taban \xfclseri, beyaz \xe7izgi hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131, laminitis, \xf6k\xe7e \xe7\xfcr\xfc\u011f\xfc",B.baK)
B.bf7=s(["Buza\u011f\u0131 ve dana bar\u0131naklar\u0131nda hava ak\u0131m\u0131 var, cereyan yok; amonyak kokusu olmas\u0131n.","Solunum karma a\u015f\u0131lar\u0131 (IBR-BVD-BRSV-PI3, Pasteurella) programa g\xf6re, sat\u0131n al\u0131nan hayvana karantina + a\u015f\u0131.","Kolostrum: ilk 2 saatte 4 litre, 12 saatte toplam 6 litre; pasif ba\u011f\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k kontrol\xfc.","Grup kar\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131, nakil ve s\xfctten kesim ayn\u0131 zamana gelmesin; a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 kalabal\u0131k \xf6nlensin.","\u0130lk ate\u015fte (39,5\xb0C \xfcst\xfc) erken tedavi; \xf6l\xfcmlerde akci\u011fer otopsisi."],t.s)
B.byF=new A.dd("BRSV, PI-3, IBR, BVD vir\xfcsleri; Mannheimia, Pasteurella, Histophilus, Mycoplasma bovis",B.bf7)
B.beZ=s(["Kolostrum kalitesi refraktometre ile \xf6l\xe7\xfcls\xfcn (\u2265%22 Brix); ilk 2 saatte i\xe7irilsin.","Gebe ineklere do\u011fumdan 3\u20136 hafta \xf6nce Rota-Corona-E. coli a\u015f\u0131s\u0131.","Biberon/kova her kullan\u0131mdan sonra y\u0131kan\u0131p dezenfekte edilsin; s\xfct s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 sabit.","Do\u011fumhane ve kul\xfcbeler her do\u011fum/buza\u011f\u0131 aras\u0131 temizlik + kire\xe7leme.","\u0130shalli buza\u011f\u0131ya erken a\u011f\u0131zdan elektrolit; s\xfct\xfc kesmeden ayr\u0131 besleme."],t.s)
B.byx=new A.dd("E. coli (K99), Rota/Corona vir\xfcs, Cryptosporidium, Salmonella, Coccidia; kolostrum yetersizli\u011fi",B.beZ)
